// The core of Mitra, started again from the inside. Start here.
//
// The model is aside from the code: one file per subject, and the code
// of a subject is the file of the same name under src/.
//
// From the inside out:
//
//   piece.mitra   something said, what is believed of it, the evidence
//                 that moves that belief. Reads nothing.
//   value.mitra   what is computed, its type, the expression that
//                 computes it. Reads nothing.
//   claim.mitra   the seam: a piece with a statement. Computing the
//                 statement makes evidence. Reads both.
//
// The two sides never read each other, and a value never depends on a
// piece (tests/wall.rs).
